WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.900
Guile approaches crouching Dhalsim with raw Drive Rush.

2
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:01.350
Crouching medium kick begins the crouching-target conversion.

3
00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:01.700
Crouching medium punch links after the low starter.

4
00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:02.250
Perfect light Sonic Boom connects after crouching medium punch.

5
00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:02.600
Crouching light punch links before the medium Boom.

6
00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Perfect medium Sonic Boom continues the route.

7
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:03.700
Back heavy punch links before the final Boom.

8
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:04.600
Perfect light Sonic Boom connects after back heavy punch.

9
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:05.200
Standing heavy kick finishes the conversion without using Super.

10
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:05.600
Dhalsim recovers at the final spacing after the heavy kick.
